  message: "Shipped in PR #3718 (merged aa3802ed10). Found and hardened 10 vulnerable sites (tracker had cited 7 with stale line numbers, but principle applied broadly): 3 in scripts/auto-pr, 2 in scripts/lib/forgejo-api.sh, 5 in scripts/ci-failover. Each switched from `git rev-parse <ref>` to `git rev-parse --verify <ref>^{commit}` to eliminate stdout contamination on unresolvable refs. Short rationale header comment added near first occurrence in each file pointing at release-check:93-102 for the long-form explanation. 100% coverage, all 10385 tests pass."  # 400d
